# Build inputs pinned for reproducible builds and packages, sourced by
# scripts/lib.sh and the build and test scripts; the CI workflows read it in
# their setup jobs (docs/ci.md, Pins).
#
# - Container images by digest: the multi-arch index, so each architecture
#   resolves to the same image. `docker buildx imagetools inspect <tag>`
#   prints a tag's current digest (Digest:).
# - Go by version and the checksums go.dev/dl publishes: the Linux binaries
#   install it (scripts/ci-build-linux.sh), and the Flatpak and the macOS and
#   Windows jobs use the same version.
# - Node.js for the macOS build: the version in the node image below.
# - The Flatpak's GNOME SDK and Platform by commit, for x86_64:
#   `flatpak remote-info flathub org.gnome.Sdk//<version>` prints it.
#
# Bump on purpose, in a commit of its own, and rebuild. The golang image
# follows go.mod's Go minor, the node image the Node major in scripts/lib.sh.
POSTSONDE_PIN_GOLANG=golang:1.27-trixie@sha256:af1bfc2614ebb1dbd31af514b78740fd678850e76498762b425ecee4c5c6ea80
POSTSONDE_PIN_NODE=node:26-trixie-slim@sha256:36793bcbb160a6a16cede1e62b93f84e26b78a972a8a4c0b879c1c12f22761ec
POSTSONDE_PIN_UBUNTU_24_04=ubuntu:24.04@sha256:68ee22004a9109b44973313b02ff7b1de250f1de0f5ecb628d73f579aaff33ac
POSTSONDE_PIN_UBUNTU_22_04=ubuntu:22.04@sha256:0a9887931b0e38af2e3487ed39e29436b0535c4f3f52e57745baaf79d1898956
POSTSONDE_PIN_DEBIAN_13=debian:13@sha256:9c6e381421d0f48d1b8133e573f33c185ee16cbf505eda9c4a8a4791b25ea8a6
POSTSONDE_PIN_DEBIAN_12=debian:12@sha256:268fb24c39bca92d326dd83ea3abebe4a3f7751c804ffef23bb6d857dd343ff8
POSTSONDE_PIN_FEDORA_44=registry.fedoraproject.org/fedora:44@sha256:526646a990bb8442f936827d98253677dd7a4c28fad33f938e32c7ffdadb72c1
POSTSONDE_PIN_FEDORA_45=registry.fedoraproject.org/fedora:45@sha256:b3bfa9b46c1a42b87020ea9053b56d24d713a0c551427669dee177230f1c720e
